From 07135fd6d18e994eb171b7bc645f52ee575f43bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HampterDev <131729366+HampterDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 00:07:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Stop requesting the nonexistent option window 0xd

When the saved OPTIONWNDINFO.SHOW is set, make_basic_info requests
window 0xd. No factory creates 0xd, and neither does the 2022-04-06
executable's MakeWindow, where 0xd takes the default branch. This client
never sets the flag to 1; it only reads it and writes it back.
ui_window_mgr_make_window adds the ID to the ESC window list before it
looks for a factory, and ui_window_mgr_post_quit1 forgets only windows
it closed, so 0xd stays in the list. Once it is the first entry, ESC
tries to close it, fails, and opens the ESC menu instead of cancelling
active navigation guidance (guideState == 2).

Drop the request. The saved value is still read and written unchanged.

Validation: the new test_basic_info_restore runs the extracted factory
over the saved shown flags and checks the windows it reopens; it fails
without the fix. Release build without warnings; the full behavioral
suite passed on the completed series.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VaQB81YtRGLtH8zvfX7WTY
---
 src/ui/wndmgr/make_window_character.c |   2 -
 tests/build.bat                       |   3 +
 tests/build_basic_info_restore.bat    |  15 ++++
 tests/extract_basic_info_restore.py   |  14 ++++
 tests/test_basic_info_restore.c       | 100 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/build_basic_info_restore.bat
 create mode 100644 tests/extract_basic_info_restore.py
 create mode 100644 tests/test_basic_info_restore.c

diff --git a/src/ui/wndmgr/make_window_character.c b/src/ui/wndmgr/make_window_character.c
index f76504d..cf250d5 100644
--- a/src/ui/wndmgr/make_window_character.c
+++ b/src/ui/wndmgr/make_window_character.c
@@ -63,8 +63,6 @@ static struct UIWindow *make_basic_info(struct UIWindowMgr *self)
         ui_window_mgr_make_window(self, 0xa);
     if (self->status_info.show)
         ui_window_mgr_make_window(self, 0xb);
-    if (self->option_info.show)
-        ui_window_mgr_make_window(self, 0xd);
     if (self->skill_list_info.show)
         ui_window_mgr_make_window(self, 0x25);
     if (self->quest_info.show)
diff --git a/tests/build.bat b/tests/build.bat
index 55c4e1e..ecaad9f 100644
--- a/tests/build.bat
+++ b/tests/build.bat
@@ -847,3 +847,6 @@ if not "%errorlevel%"=="0" exit /b 1

 call "%~dp0build_status_wnd_info.bat"
 if not "%errorlevel%"=="0" exit /b 1
